    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game  combines Hidden Object with Music Creation! And you will be the conducting maestro! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1500+ hidden objects </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >360 Singers! Each singer plays a different melody </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find fans around town to get more money </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hint System </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shop System with 10 different musicians to hire</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a beautifully hand-drawn scenery! They are all ultra-cute kittens, hand-animated with an exclusive soundtrack composed solely for the game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game  combines Hidden Object with Music Creation! And you will be the conducting maestro! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1500+ hidden objects </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >360 Singers! Each singer plays a different melody </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find fans around town to get more money </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hint System </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shop System with 10 different musicians to hire</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a beautifully hand-drawn scenery! They are all ultra-cute kittens, hand-animated with an exclusive soundtrack composed solely for the game.</p>",
    "short_description": "A musical hidden object game where you search the streets of 9 CITIES for singing kittens from a choir and money bags to hire and assemble a cat band. As orchestra conductor, you'll be able to configure the musicians as you wish, creating your own music and choir melodies. Find them all!",
